# LANDFALL: the hatcher (the Metamorpher's job): a free shot for 1 damage
# that ricochets off walls. When its shot lands the last hit, the creature
# becomes a harmless hatchling for six seconds, then grows back whole; a
# hatchling knocked out by anything else drops the second-rarest resource,
# and bog boots stomp it. A ricochet that comes back into Wick shrinks her:
# small, she slips through a hole in a wall (and can't use or take tools),
# with a moment of safety each time she shrinks or grows. A crystal hit
# turns to flesh for a while.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 1
cheat hold 2 1
cheat species 3 0 0
cheat spset 3 2 1 0
cheat mob 3 100 113
cheat pos 60 114
cheat face 1
press A
wait 20
expect mob0_hp == 1
# half a second between shots
press A
wait 20
expect mob0_hp == 1
press A
wait 20
expect morphed == 1
expect mob0_flags & 8
expect mob0_alive == 1
# a hatchling is harmless to touch
hold RIGHT 40
expect hp == 3
expect hits == 0
# six seconds on it grows back, whole
wait 330
expect morphed == 0
expect mob0_hp == 2
# hatched again, then a rivet: the second-rarest resource (beads here)
cheat clear
cheat mob 3 100 113
cheat pos 60 114
cheat face 1
press A
wait 31
press A
wait 20
expect morphed == 1
press B 3
expect active == 1
wait 10
press A
wait 20
expect mob0_alive == 0
expect drops_res0 == 1
# the bog boots stomp a hatchling (even from the other hand)
cheat clear
cheat clearitems
cheat hold 2 5
cheat mob 3 100 113
cheat pos 80 114
cheat face 1
press A
wait 31
press A
wait 8
expect morphed == 1
hold RIGHT 25
expect mob0_alive == 0
expect hp == 3
# a ricochet off the wall behind her: small
cheat clear
cheat clearitems
cheat hold 2 1
cheat pos 20 114
cheat face 3
press A
wait 20
expect small == 1
expect inv > 0
# small, she can't fire or take tools
press A
expect shots == 0
# a wall with a hole: small she goes through, full size she can't
cheat tile 10 1 3
cheat tile 10 2 3
cheat tile 10 3 3
cheat tile 10 4 3
cheat tile 10 5 3
cheat tile 10 6 3
cheat tile 10 7 14
hold RIGHT 150
expect px > 176
# she grows back after six seconds, with room around her
expect small == 1
waituntil small == 0 400
expect inv > 50
hold LEFT 60
expect px >= 176
# a crystal hit by the hatcher turns to flesh, and back
cheat tile 14 7 7
cheat pos 190 114
cheat face 1
press A
wait 10
expect tile_14_7 == 8
wait 360
expect tile_14_7 == 7
